## Everything here is ours

This MIT licence covers the whole repository, with no carve-out.

That was not true between D-034 and D-042. The client's art was a vendored
third-party pixel pack whose terms permit use in a game and withhold
redistribution, so a section here had to say which half of the tree the licence
did not reach. The 3D rework removed it: every surface in the station is now
geometry built in code and textures drawn into a canvas at runtime, and the
twelve glyphs and both bodies were always authored in this repository.

There are no image files in this project at all. Getting the carve-out back is
therefore a decision somebody would have to make deliberately, which is the
point of writing it down.
